/v1/","context":{"app_id":2064310,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2064310","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:31:34Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3137950","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2064310-1846018067936876","game_id":"steam-2064310","kind":"announcement","title":"Dark Age Dinos is Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"It’s time, dino fans!A new (and final) Dark Age Dinos demo is coming to Steam Next Fest Oct 19th. The game has changed so much with your feedback that it’s hard to even list it all! We’ll try anyway.The TavernThe new character screen gives your party a classic starting point while providing 500% more dinosaur. We did the math.New MapThe map of Cretacia is more mysterious. And dour. And beautiful. And abstract. It’s also been reworked to give more interesting strategic choices at each fork in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:44:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936876","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2064310-1830163047258638","game_id":"steam-2064310","kind":"announcement","title":"Faces & Flora","summary":"Spring has sprung dino fans! Another season, another demo update. The full game has had a surge of progress this year and we're happy to be sharing some of the improvements with our little demo community. First, we've added hand-drawn facial animations for every character in the game. Look forward to your favourite dinosaurs wincing in pain and cheering in triumph.Second, our Fight maps have undergone a significant overhaul. Environmental improvements, biome lighting, map-driven set pieces and b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T21:44:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2064310-1818118366174332","game_id":"steam-2064310","kind":"update","title":"Reconnect Demo Update","summary":"Hey Dark Age Dino fans! We come to deliver another demo update. What better way to kick back and relax over the holidays than bundled up with your favourite Dinosaurs? We've heard your cries of despair as your runs were dashed by internet outages. We've seen you have to end a run early because real life needs your attention. Well...no more! With the Reconnect update, you'll be able to quit and resume journeys between fights and can reinvite players that disconnected. Headline Features Reconnect:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-04T20:20:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366174332","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2064310-1802354289735653","game_id":"steam-2064310","kind":"update","title":"Dark Age Dinos - Summer Update","summary":"Hey Dark Age Dinos lovers!We've got another small update to the demo to tide you over for the summer.Rewards are now delivered via shiny chestsAll spell and impact VFX have been improvedYou'll leave evidence of your carnageThe map has been spruced up to show some full release points of interestAnd of course, additional bug fixesDon't forget to share your feedback with us via the Feedback button in game. Dark Age Dinos can only reach its full potential with help from players, like yourselves!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-17T21:30:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802354289735653","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2064310-1794102528110072","game_id":"steam-2064310","kind":"update","title":"Dark Age Dinos - Spring Update","summary":"Spring is in the air! Our team has emerged from hibernation bearing a new demo update for you all to enjoy over your spring breaks. Once again this update is just too large to give an exhaustive list, but here are some of the headlines: Cretacia’s shopkeepers got an extra large order of healing flasks recently and they’re practically giving them away. You can now buy back used flasks from any shop A local shopkeeper recently got a killer deal on some property behind the demo’s miniboss. There wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-14T14:40:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528110072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2064310-1788311419147697","game_id":"steam-2064310","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.4 Is Live Now!","summary":"Hey Dark Age Dinos fans! The v0.4 demo update goes live TODAY! Our team has been loving hearing all of your feedback since our Demo launched in August. You’ve laughed, you’ve cried, you’ve raged and most of all - you’ve been having a blast! The quality of our updates relies on honest feedback from our players, so keep it up. We want to hear how v0.4 feels to you. While you’ve been quaffing flasks, we’ve been hard at work improving the core of the game and adding some much-requested quality of li","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-13T15:33:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.n